0 EV3 wall stopper (Brickwright Robot Lab reference model)
0 Name: ev3-wall-stopper.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // A MINDSTORMS EV3 brick between two Technic beams 15 (2L pins: brick to beam at the front, beam to motor at the back), two
0 // EV3 large motors behind it with their drive hubs at the rear (B left, C right) turning 88 mm
0 // wheels, two free 88 mm wheels on 3L axles turning in the beams, and an EV3 ultrasonic
0 // sensor (input 4) held between the front of the beams by two axles, looking ahead.
0 // Forward is LDraw +z.
